## The game

The builder reads **your own** game dump and keys. It writes the `.nup` and the
pack for **your** phone; neither this repository nor its releases carry game
data, keys, console firmware or translated game code/shaders. Do not share the
pack or the `.nup`: they contain the game's data. The game's names and data
belong to their owners; this project is not affiliated with Nintendo, Bandai
Namco or Sora Ltd.
